WEBVTT

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:45.950
Arthur regretted pulling the sword from the stone,

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:49.619
but he never gave up his quest.

00:00:49.619 --> 00:00:51.619
So why did you?

00:00:51.619 --> 00:00:54.619
Or have you already found the traveler

00:00:54.619 --> 00:00:57.619
that you and the less fortunate members of Veritas were looking for?

00:00:57.619 --> 00:01:00.619
The traveler.

00:01:00.619 --> 00:01:02.619
Why doesn't it surprise me that you've fallen

00:01:02.619 --> 00:01:04.620
for Patricia Swan's vivid imaginings?

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:08.620
I didn't imagine the deaths of Virgil Swan or Oliver Queen's parents.

00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:11.620
You think I can control the fate of individuals?

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:13.620
Oh God.

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:14.620
You give me too much credit.

00:01:14.620 --> 00:01:16.620
You certainly controlled mine.

00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:20.280
It wasn't an accident.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:22.280
We were in Smallville, the day the meteor shower, was it?

00:01:22.280 --> 00:01:25.819
The factory was just the cover.

00:01:25.819 --> 00:01:28.819
You were really there to meet this traveler

00:01:28.819 --> 00:01:30.819
that Veritas wanted to protect.

00:01:30.819 --> 00:01:32.819
I remember everything, Dad.

00:01:32.819 --> 00:01:35.819
Those are the memories of a small boy in shock

00:01:35.819 --> 00:01:38.819
trying to cope with the trauma of a meteor shower.

00:01:38.819 --> 00:01:40.819
A trauma brought on by my own father.

00:01:40.819 --> 00:01:47.650
My life changed forever that day.

00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:58.900
For the traveler.

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:21.120
But if I told you now that you have

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:23.120
that you are the traveler.

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:34.259
You're right.

00:02:34.259 --> 00:02:36.259
Your life truly changed that day.

00:02:36.259 --> 00:02:39.259
I told you in the helicopter that you were destined for a great future.

00:02:39.259 --> 00:02:41.259
That's why I've been so hard on you.

00:02:41.259 --> 00:02:43.259
Trained you so relentlessly.

00:02:43.259 --> 00:02:45.259
Think, Lex, think.

00:02:45.259 --> 00:02:48.259
You have survived mortal injuries so many times.

00:02:48.259 --> 00:02:53.689
How else can you explain it?

00:02:53.689 --> 00:02:55.689
Because I was trained never to accept defeat.

00:02:55.689 --> 00:03:01.280
When I get my hands in that box in Zurich,

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:05.280
I have a feeling all my questions will be answered.

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:19.110
Lex,

00:03:19.110 --> 00:03:22.189
I know.

00:03:22.189 --> 00:03:26.189
I know how strong it is, the attraction of the dark power.

00:03:26.189 --> 00:03:29.189
But it will destroy you.

00:03:29.189 --> 00:03:32.189
I can't let you go down that terrible path.

00:03:32.189 --> 00:03:37.139
You must not open that box.

00:03:37.139 --> 00:03:42.139
I can't open it, because I need a second key.

00:03:42.139 --> 00:03:57.750
Give it to me.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:04:02.289
