00:04:02.289 --> 00:04:08.659
I finally realized there's only one person you would trust it with.

00:04:08.659 --> 00:04:09.659
Yourself.

00:04:09.659 --> 00:04:16.860
Lex, Lex, if you open that box,

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:18.860
If you get hold of that secret,

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:21.860
there will be no redemption for you.

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:25.399
No redemption, ever.

00:04:25.399 --> 00:04:27.399
I was raised in your shadow.

00:04:27.399 --> 00:04:31.959
Now you're gonna die in mine.

00:04:31.959 --> 00:04:38.310
No one will even remember your name.

00:04:38.310 --> 00:05:51.060
