00:05:51.060 --> 00:05:53.060
I've traveled halfway around the world via satellite.

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:56.060
There's no trace of care around Brainiac.

00:05:56.060 --> 00:05:58.060
My camera in pain.

00:05:58.060 --> 00:06:00.060
The only way to help her is to find Brainiac.

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:02.060
I've tapped every radar screen known to mankind.

00:06:02.060 --> 00:06:03.060
I've tapped every radar screen known to mankind.

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:05.060
I mean, there's no bogey or blip unaccounted for.

00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:07.060
It's like they just flew off the map.

00:06:07.060 --> 00:06:09.060
What about Brainiac's power sources?

00:06:09.060 --> 00:06:21.379
