00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:44.300
I know how difficult this must be for you, Mr. Luther, but I need a positive identification.

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:48.509
Whenever you're ready.

00:07:48.509 --> 00:08:19.660
Apparently, we're finding.

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:32.830
You killed him?

