00:13:26.470 --> 00:13:36.769
He was mean sometimes, but he loved his legs.

00:13:36.769 --> 00:13:38.769
Get out of my head.

00:13:38.769 --> 00:13:40.769
Get out of my head!

00:13:40.769 --> 00:13:44.500
You shouldn't have...

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:45.500
Dad, no sure!

00:13:45.500 --> 00:16:11.580
I believe that my greatest accompliting your life and serving you.

