But if you are reading this, it means that I cannot protect you any longer from a terrible truth.

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:22.179
Two lockets exist.

00:16:22.179 --> 00:16:23.179
Two. Each one has its own.

00:16:23.179 --> 00:16:25.179
has its own key.

00:16:25.179 --> 00:16:29.179
These keys used together unlock the secret of controlling you.

00:16:29.179 --> 00:16:36.899
You must find the keys, Calell, or your destiny will fall into the hands of another man.

