00:27:43.839 --> 00:27:49.369
I'm grieving, Clark. I think you know what it's like to lose a father.

00:27:49.369 --> 00:27:52.369
Don't bring my father into this.

00:27:52.369 --> 00:27:55.839
Why not?

00:27:55.839 --> 00:27:57.839
Our fathers were a lot alike.

00:27:57.839 --> 00:28:01.839
Smart, strong-willed, and both died prematurely.

00:28:01.839 --> 00:28:07.079
You know you're right, Lex.

00:28:07.079 --> 00:28:10.079
Lionel did die too soon.

00:28:10.079 --> 00:28:12.079
I want to know the truth about how he died.

00:28:12.079 --> 00:28:14.079
The truth is.

00:28:14.079 --> 00:28:16.079
Our dads were alike in another way.

00:28:16.079 --> 00:28:21.559
like in another way.

00:28:21.559 --> 00:28:24.559
See, they both felt that you were the kind of son a father could be proud of.

00:28:24.559 --> 00:28:28.559
They would have felt the same way about you, Lex.

00:28:28.559 --> 00:28:32.559
If you would have tried, what happened to you?

00:28:32.559 --> 00:28:35.559
I did try, Clark.

00:28:35.559 --> 00:28:42.099
In fact, when we first met, you inspired me.

00:28:42.099 --> 00:28:47.099
All I wanted was to be your friend, but turn your back on me.

00:28:47.099 --> 00:28:54.900
So you're the person you are today because of me.

00:28:54.900 --> 00:28:55.900
I tried to be your friend.

00:28:55.900 --> 00:28:57.900
Len, Lex.

00:28:57.900 --> 00:28:59.900
But all you care about is power and control.

00:28:59.900 --> 00:29:01.900
This is Smallville!

00:29:01.900 --> 00:29:05.900
Meteor freaks, alien ships, cryptic symbols.

00:29:05.900 --> 00:29:07.900
These threats are real.

00:29:07.900 --> 00:29:09.900
Someone had to take control.

00:29:09.900 --> 00:29:11.900
Someone has to protect the world.

00:29:11.900 --> 00:29:13.900
Listen to yourself, Lex.

00:29:13.900 --> 00:29:16.900
You're so caught up in your own delusions you've lost track of reality.

00:29:16.900 --> 00:29:18.900
Have I?

00:29:18.900 --> 00:29:24.940
Then let's talk about something you can't deny.

00:29:24.940 --> 00:29:27.940
After years of pleading with my father to show me some compassion,

00:29:27.940 --> 00:29:32.940
passion, he turned to you with open arms.

00:29:32.940 --> 00:29:37.940
Now, what would a worldly billionaire have in common

00:29:37.940 --> 00:29:39.940
with a simple farm boy?

00:29:39.940 --> 00:29:50.519
Maybe he just knew he could trust me.

00:29:50.519 --> 00:29:53.519
Everyone can trust Clark Kent.

00:29:53.519 --> 00:29:55.519
You're the perfect son.

00:29:55.519 --> 00:30:02.410
So, so why did Jonathan Kent always seem so stressed?

00:30:02.410 --> 00:30:09.799
I mean, was raising the perfect son really that much work?

00:30:09.799 --> 00:30:10.799
I wonder how much of his son?

00:30:10.799 --> 00:30:15.269
strain and put on his heart.

00:30:15.269 --> 00:30:17.269
Are you blaming me for my father's death?

00:30:17.269 --> 00:30:19.269
Are you?

00:30:19.269 --> 00:30:23.799
You're the guilty one, Lex, not me.

00:30:23.799 --> 00:30:25.799
And this time, you're gonna own up to what you've done.

00:30:25.799 --> 00:30:29.200
I know you killed Lionel.

00:30:29.200 --> 00:30:33.339
Who's delusional now?

00:30:33.339 --> 00:30:35.339
I have proof.

00:30:35.339 --> 00:31:17.049
You really did it, Lex.

00:31:17.049 --> 00:31:45.089
Chloe!

00:31:45.089 --> 00:31:52.750
Chloe?

00:31:52.750 --> 00:31:54.750
Chloe, you in here?

00:31:54.750 --> 00:31:56.750
Chloe, what happened?

00:31:56.750 --> 00:31:57.750
Okay?

00:31:57.750 --> 00:32:03.809
Somebody hit me.

00:32:03.809 --> 00:32:04.809
They destroyed the picture.

00:32:04.809 --> 00:32:06.809
But you were right, Clark.

00:32:06.809 --> 00:32:09.809
But you were right, Clark. I saw the picture. It was Lex.

00:32:09.809 --> 00:32:17.240
When I went to see Lex, I found Landl's Lockett. But without that photograph, we can't prove anything.

00:32:17.240 --> 00:32:18.240
What about the key?

00:32:18.240 --> 00:32:22.619
I actually read the entire mansion. It's nowhere to be found.

00:32:22.619 --> 00:32:24.619
What happened to Jimmy and Lois? Where are they?

00:32:24.619 --> 00:32:28.619
I don't know. And I'm worried. The last I heard they were leaving the Daily Planet.

00:32:28.619 --> 00:32:31.619
If whoever attacked me followed the photo from there to hear...

00:32:31.619 --> 00:32:33.619
You may have stopped Jimmy and Lois from leaving the building.

00:32:33.619 --> 00:32:35.619
I'm not going to go.

00:32:35.619 --> 00:32:40.599
Clark, if Lex has both of those keys, not only will he discover your secret

00:32:40.619 --> 00:32:43.619
but he'll have total and complete power over you.

00:32:43.619 --> 00:32:48.309
Now that's not just your worst nightmare.

00:32:48.309 --> 00:32:50.309
It's everyone else's too.

00:32:50.309 --> 00:33:10.970
Be careful.

00:33:10.970 --> 00:33:11.970
I've got an exclusive for you.

00:33:11.970 --> 00:33:20.380
When you get out of here, Lois Lane,

00:33:20.380 --> 00:33:23.380
and Jimmy Alston are gonna be world famous.

00:33:23.380 --> 00:33:42.640
Plenty headlines of us. I can see you now.

00:33:42.640 --> 00:33:44.640
It's gonna be great, Lois.

00:33:44.640 --> 00:34:38.070
This is Tina.

00:34:38.070 --> 00:34:40.070
Please call me back.

00:34:40.070 --> 00:34:42.070
I found who you've been searching for.

00:34:42.070 --> 00:34:45.070
I know who the traveler is.

00:34:45.070 --> 00:35:54.400
After the funeral, I plan on taking some time off.

00:35:54.400 --> 00:35:56.400
Get the jet ready.

00:35:56.400 --> 00:35:58.780
Zurich.

00:35:58.780 --> 00:36:11.400
Can't run away, Lex.

00:36:11.400 --> 00:36:15.400
No matter where you go, I'll always be there.

00:36:15.400 --> 00:36:19.900
Can't get rid of me.

00:36:19.900 --> 00:36:24.590
You need my help.

00:36:24.590 --> 00:36:29.889
You're still good inside you. I know it.

00:36:29.889 --> 00:36:31.889
I don't want your help.

00:36:31.889 --> 00:36:33.889
Don't go to Zurich.

00:36:33.889 --> 00:36:40.530
I'm going. I have to.

00:36:40.530 --> 00:36:41.530
Dad was right.

00:36:41.530 --> 00:36:48.280
That was right. If you open the box, it will destroy you.

00:36:49.280 --> 00:36:52.820
It's all I have left.

00:36:52.820 --> 00:37:07.530
It's not true. It'll have me.

00:37:07.530 --> 00:37:25.889
I'm done listening to you. Me weak.

00:37:25.889 --> 00:38:18.710
Long night.

00:38:18.710 --> 00:38:22.659
It's good to see the sun again.

00:38:22.659 --> 00:38:26.800
It's too bad Lionel's not here to see it.

00:38:26.800 --> 00:38:29.800
Lex closed the funeral to any and all guests.

00:38:29.800 --> 00:38:33.800
In other words, Lex is the only one invited.

00:38:33.800 --> 00:38:42.239
Lionel deserves better.

00:38:42.239 --> 00:38:46.090
At least we know how Lionel truly

00:38:46.090 --> 00:38:50.090
felt about you. I mean, he thought of you as his second son.

00:38:50.090 --> 00:38:54.630
Another person who treated me like his son and died because of it.

00:38:54.630 --> 00:38:55.630
Clark...

00:38:55.630 --> 00:38:57.630
Jurel died getting me on that ship.

00:38:57.630 --> 00:39:02.940
My dad died of a heart attack from the powers he took on protecting me.

00:39:02.940 --> 00:39:11.929
And now Lionel's been murdered for protecting my secret.

00:39:11.929 --> 00:39:13.929
They did die for you, Clark.

00:39:13.929 --> 00:39:15.929
But ultimately, they died for all of us.

00:39:15.929 --> 00:39:19.929
There was a reason those men were in your life.

00:39:19.929 --> 00:39:22.929
Each of them added something to the man that you are today.

00:39:22.929 --> 00:39:26.630
How could Lex have done it?

00:39:26.630 --> 00:39:31.940
How does his son murder his own father?

00:39:31.940 --> 00:39:41.849
Total absence of love.

00:39:41.849 --> 00:39:43.849
Some say that's the definition of evil.

00:39:43.849 --> 00:39:49.349
You have to get those keys away from Lex, Clark,

00:39:49.349 --> 00:39:54.519
before he kills anyone else.

00:39:54.519 --> 00:39:59.809
He's not going to have the chance.

00:39:59.809 --> 00:40:00.809
I won't let him.

